Z||000017||LT1 Chop Top||06-21-2001||01:19 PM||||I am actually re-doing the interior right now with ACC black floor carpet, Mr. Mikes black door carpet, and having much of the interior dyed black (already has black leather seats).  I only have one door skin off left to finish.  I am leaving the dash stock black and grey because I don't really feel like undertaking removing it until I get a new one...like a Pisa (anyone have one for sale??).  I will certainly post interior pics when I am done.||||reg||14
